{"id":"34","title":"Shops and Services","goal":"Recognize useful places and payment words, then use a selected set to explain what you need.","study":[{"id":"34-study-0","title":"Start here","blocks":[{"id":"ch34-b0","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"These words support the service conversations in Chapters 35–44. Begin with places you are likely to use; the list is a reference, not a memorization test."}],"span":[6,6],"phraseIds":[]},{"id":"ch34-b1","type":"table","header":[[{"text":"Place"}],[{"text":"What the word identifies"}]],"rows":[[[{"text":"grocery store / supermarket"}],[{"text":"a store selling food and everyday supplies"}]],[[{"text":"convenience store"}],[{"text":"a smaller store selling a range of everyday items"}]],[[{"text":"hardware store"}],[{"text":"a store selling tools and home-project supplies"}]],[[{"text":"garden center"}],[{"text":"a place selling plants and gardening supplies"}]],[[{"text":"gas station"}],[{"text":"a place where vehicles can get fuel"}]],[[{"text":"shopping mall"}],[{"text":"a group of stores in a shopping complex"}]],[[{"text":"pharmacy"}],[{"text":"a place to ask about or obtain medicines"}]],[[{"text":"post office"}],[{"text":"a place providing postal services"}]],[[{"text":"library"}],[{"text":"a place offering books and other information resources"}]],[[{"text":"bank"}],[{"text":"a business providing financial services"}]]],"span":[8,19],"phraseIds":["ch34-p152554743837932","ch34-p151591876657435","ch34-p228331087654292","ch34-p206647790336621","ch34-p133502944008272","ch34-p115825383582297","ch34-p86252867359636","ch34-p75972037519634","ch34-p104315780759297","ch34-p235954326532976"],"phraseCells":[["ch34-p152554743837932",null],["ch34-p151591876657435",null],["ch34-p228331087654292",null],["ch34-p206647790336621",null],["ch34-p133502944008272",null],["ch34-p115825383582297",null],["ch34-p86252867359636",null],["ch34-p75972037519634",null],["ch34-p104315780759297",null],["ch34-p235954326532976",null]]},{"id":"ch34-b2","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"Other useful store names are "},{"text":"bakery","emphasis":true},{"text":" for bread and baked goods, "},{"text":"butcher shop","emphasis":true},{"text":" for meat, "},{"text":"florist","emphasis":true},{"text":" for flowers, "},{"text":"bookstore","emphasis":true},{"text":" for books, "},{"text":"shoe store","emphasis":true},{"text":" for footwear, and "},{"text":"hair salon","emphasis":true},{"text":" or "},{"text":"barbershop","emphasis":true},{"text":" for hair services. A store may sell more than its name suggests; ask when you are unsure."}],"span":[21,21],"phraseIds":["ch34-p192889280855224","ch34-p177482131105402","ch34-p231122365931509","ch34-p13231975760427","ch34-p206250611308419","ch34-p78489412338708","ch34-p1531632892230"]}],"line":6,"ja":"","theme":"shops"},{"id":"34-study-1","title":"People and places inside","blocks":[{"id":"ch34-b3","type":"explanation","runs":[{"text":"A "},{"text":"customer","emphasis":true},{"text":" buys or uses a service. A "},{"text":"cashier","emphasis":true},{"text":" handles checkout. A "},{"text":"sales associate","emphasis":true},{"text":" helps customers in a store. "},{"text":"Checkout","emphasis":true},{"text":" is the place or process of paying. An "},{"text":"aisle","emphasis":true},{"text":" is a passage between shelves. A "},{"text":"line","emphasis":true},{"text":" is people waiting their turn: "},{"text":"Is this the line for checkout?","emphasis":true}],"span":[25,25],"phraseIds":["ch34-p84250746316712","ch34-p75319353978382","ch34-p19803752279410","ch34-p275905633180014","ch34-p240925446402121","ch34-p29349505181071","ch34-p220189534564309"]}],"line":23,"ja":"","theme":"shops"},{"id":"34-study-2","title":"Money and purchases","blocks":[{"id":"ch34-b4","type":"table","header":[[{"text":"Word"}],[{"text":"Meaning in a shopping task"}]],"rows":[[[{"text":"cash"}],[{"text":"physical money: bills and coins"}]],[[{"text":"debit card"}],[{"text":"a card that uses money in 